### PR2 A3 legacy — Heartbeat pending approval, plain-text → wire body "2" (FusionX)
POST {{Intellinode.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/agents/heartbeat?format=legacy
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/plain
Authorization: Bearer {{pr2AgentToken}}

