### Keyboard — agent ack failed (FusionX Reason parity)
POST {{Intellinode.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/agents/tasks/ack
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

{
  "acknowledgements": [
    {
      "taskId": "{{keyboardTaskId}}",
      "legacyTaskId": {{keyboardLegacyTaskId}},
      "status": "Failed",
      "reason": "Failed to set keyboard layout: 0x80070057"
    }
  ]
}

# Expected: 204 No Content; lastApplyStatus=Failed, lastApplyMessage matches reason; desired delay/locale unchanged


### Keyboard — Apply history (all)
