GET {{Intellinode.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/device-config/keyboard/apply-history/{{keyboardMac}}?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

# Expected: 200 with keyboard-scoped tasks + apply logs (may include task+log pairs per apply)


### Keyboard — Apply history (failed only — FusionX UnSuccessful / Reason)
GET {{Intellinode.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/device-config/keyboard/apply-history/{{keyboardMac}}?status=Failed&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

